@startuml
!theme plain
!pragma layout smetana
title 2. Saga 사가 상태 (SagaStatus + SagaStep)
hide empty description

[*] --> STARTED
STARTED --> IN_PROGRESS : stock.check 발행

state IN_PROGRESS {
  [*] --> STOCK
  STOCK --> PAYMENT : 재고 차감 완료
  PAYMENT --> SHIPMENT : 결제 완료
  STOCK : productStatus\nPENDING → DEDUCTED / INSUFFICIENT
  PAYMENT : paymentStatus\nPENDING → COMPLETED / FAILED
  SHIPMENT : shipmentStatus\nPENDING → CREATED / FAILED
}

IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : shipment.created
IN_PROGRESS -[#red]-> FAILED : 재고 부족\n(보상할 것 없음)
IN_PROGRESS -[#orange]-> COMPENSATING : 결제 실패 / 배송 실패\n사용자 취소
COMPENSATING -[#orange]-> COMPENSATED : 보상 완료

COMPLETED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
COMPENSATED --> [*]

note right of COMPENSATING
  보상 대상은 단계별 결과로 판단
  paymentStatus == COMPLETED → payment.cancel
  productStatus == DEDUCTED → stock.restore
  SagaStep 은 보상 중에도 덮어쓰지 않음
end note

note bottom of COMPLETED
  최종 상태(COMPLETED / FAILED / COMPENSATED) 이후
  도착한 이벤트는 무시 (중복 수신 대비)
end note
@enduml
